{
  "rationale": "The plant automata G1 models the robot's perception of obstacles and motion actuation, separating sensing and motion. The specification E1 binds perception outcomes to safe and coverage-oriented actions, enforcing conservative obstacle recovery and steady exploration. E2 prevents repeated identical turns to avoid spinning in place. E3 ensures full_rotate is only used as a last-resort after repeated blockages.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate perception and motion into distinct plant automata for clarity and modularity.",
    "Specification automata enforce safe, conservative obstacle recovery, biasing toward forward progress and coverage, and prevent oscillatory or unsafe behaviors."
